stream
BT /F1 10 Tf 54 731 Td (If the folder already exists:) Tj ET
BT /F3 9 Tf 54 710 Td (cd LDC) Tj ET
BT /F3 9 Tf 54 696 Td (git pull) Tj ET
BT /F2 13 Tf 54 663 Td (Run The Setup Script) Tj ET
BT /F1 10 Tf 54 638 Td (From inside the LDC folder, run:) Tj ET
BT /F3 9 Tf 54 617 Td (./scripts/bootstrap.sh) Tj ET
BT /F1 10 Tf 54 589 Td (The script will ask for the database password, organizer password, pgAdmin) Tj ET
BT /F1 10 Tf 54 575 Td (  password, and SMTP app password. Type carefully; password prompts do not show) Tj ET
BT /F1 10 Tf 54 561 Td (  characters while you type.) Tj ET
BT /F1 10 Tf 54 540 Td (If setup has already been run on this computer, the script may say you can press) Tj ET
BT /F1 10 Tf 54 526 Td (  Enter to keep an existing password. That keeps the password already saved in .env.) Tj ET
BT /F1 10 Tf 54 505 Td (When the script asks about SMTP:) Tj ET
BT /F1 10 Tf 54 484 Td (- Use smtp.gmail.com for Gmail.) Tj ET
BT /F1 10 Tf 54 470 Td (- Use port 587.) Tj ET
BT /F1 10 Tf 54 456 Td (- Use the chapter Gmail address as the SMTP username.) Tj ET
BT /F1 10 Tf 54 442 Td (- Use a Gmail App Password, not the regular Gmail account password.) Tj ET
BT /F1 10 Tf 54 421 Td (The script creates .env, creates the database, installs dependencies, initializes) Tj ET
BT /F1 10 Tf 54 407 Td (  the database tables, and builds the site.) Tj ET
BT /F1 10 Tf 54 386 Td (After setup, the site's Audit page can load these SMTP settings from .env for a) Tj ET
BT /F1 10 Tf 54 372 Td (  logged-in organizer. Do not share .env; it contains the SMTP app password.) Tj ET
BT /F2 13 Tf 54 346 Td (Manual Settings File Option) Tj ET
BT /F1 10 Tf 54 321 Td (Run:) Tj ET
BT /F3 9 Tf 54 300 Td (cp .env.example .env) Tj ET
BT /F1 10 Tf 54 272 Td (Then open .env in a text editor. Your helper should tell you what values to use.) Tj ET
BT /F1 10 Tf 54 251 Td (The most important line is DATABASE_URL. It usually looks like this:) Tj ET
BT /F3 9 Tf 54 230 Td (DATABASE_URL=postgresql+psycopg://ldc:ldc_dev_password@localhost:5432/ldc) Tj ET
BT /F1 10 Tf 54 202 Td (If your helper gave you a different database host, port, username, or password,) Tj ET
BT /F1 10 Tf 54 188 Td (  use what they gave you.) Tj ET
BT /F2 13 Tf 54 162 Td (Start The App) Tj ET
BT /F1 10 Tf 54 137 Td (Run:) Tj ET
BT /F3 9 Tf 54 116 Td (./scripts/startup.sh) Tj ET
BT /F1 10 Tf 54 88 Td (This starts the backend and frontend services. Leave the terminal open while using) Tj ET
BT /F1 10 Tf 54 74 Td (  the site.) Tj ET
endstream
endobj
