stream
BT /F3 9 Tf 54 738 Td (./scripts/clear-dummy-data.sh) Tj ET
BT /F1 10 Tf 54 710 Td (Read the numbers it prints. This command does not delete anything.) Tj ET
BT /F1 10 Tf 54 689 Td (If the preview looks right, run:) Tj ET
BT /F3 9 Tf 54 668 Td (./scripts/clear-dummy-data.sh --yes) Tj ET
BT /F1 10 Tf 54 640 Td (This removes the sample people and synthetic test data that are only meant for) Tj ET
BT /F1 10 Tf 54 626 Td (  demos.) Tj ET
BT /F1 10 Tf 54 605 Td (If the site still shows sample people after this, reload after pulling the latest) Tj ET
BT /F1 10 Tf 54 591 Td (  version of the site. Older versions kept sample people in the browser. If they) Tj ET
BT /F1 10 Tf 54 577 Td (  still appear, clear browser storage for the site and reload.) Tj ET
BT /F1 10 Tf 54 556 Td (You can also clear browser-side console data inside the site:) Tj ET
BT /F1 10 Tf 54 535 Td (1. Open the site.) Tj ET
BT /F1 10 Tf 54 521 Td (2. Go to Audit.) Tj ET
BT /F1 10 Tf 54 507 Td (3. Find Data Management.) Tj ET
BT /F1 10 Tf 54 493 Td (4. Use Clear Participant Data to keep sessions.) Tj ET
BT /F1 10 Tf 54 479 Td (5. Use Clear Sessions Too to remove sessions as well.) Tj ET
BT /F1 10 Tf 54 465 Td (6. Type CLEAR when the confirmation box asks for it.) Tj ET
BT /F1 10 Tf 54 444 Td (Use the same Data Management panel to import participant CSV or Excel .xlsx files.) Tj ET
BT /F1 10 Tf 54 430 Td (  For LDC signup workbooks, the importer uses the populated Form Responses sheet.) Tj ET
BT /F1 10 Tf 54 409 Td (The site also tries to detect the session from the file name. For example, a) Tj ET
BT /F1 10 Tf 54 395 Td (  workbook named for DMV Summer 2026 should show DMV Summer 2026 in the Import into) Tj ET
BT /F1 10 Tf 54 381 Td (  session dropdown. If the session does not already exist, importing creates it. If) Tj ET
BT /F1 10 Tf 54 367 Td (  the dropdown shows the wrong session, choose the correct one before clicking) Tj ET
BT /F1 10 Tf 54 353 Td (  Import Previewed Rows.) Tj ET
BT /F1 10 Tf 54 332 Td (Some older date-history answers are messy free text. The site preserves them and) Tj ET
BT /F1 10 Tf 54 318 Td (  marks them Review manually when they do not exactly match a current participant) Tj ET
BT /F1 10 Tf 54 304 Td (  name.) Tj ET
BT /F1 10 Tf 54 283 Td (After import, Generate Recommendations works with the imported men and women. The) Tj ET
BT /F1 10 Tf 54 269 Td (  site understands both Male/Female and Man/Woman labels.) Tj ET
BT /F1 10 Tf 54 248 Td (Generated draft emails list each approved date with that date's phone number. If a) Tj ET
BT /F1 10 Tf 54 234 Td (  participant has no phone number on file, the draft says phone not listed so the) Tj ET
BT /F1 10 Tf 54 220 Td (  operator can fix the participant record before sending.) Tj ET
BT /F1 10 Tf 54 199 Td (To confirm email delivery can reach Gmail, open Audit, find SMTP - Gmail, and) Tj ET
BT /F1 10 Tf 54 185 Td (  click Check Relay after the SMTP fields are filled in. A green message means the) Tj ET
BT /F1 10 Tf 54 171 Td (  server can reach the SMTP relay.) Tj ET
BT /F1 10 Tf 54 150 Td (If you want to keep the sample session names but remove sample people, run:) Tj ET
BT /F3 9 Tf 54 129 Td (./scripts/clear-dummy-data.sh --keep-generated-sessions --yes) Tj ET
BT /F1 10 Tf 54 101 Td (If you are unsure, stop and ask your helper before using --yes.) Tj ET
BT /F1 10 Tf 54 80 Td (If the preview says it found zero demo records, but your helper wants a fully) Tj ET
BT /F1 10 Tf 54 66 Td (  empty chapter database, run:) Tj ET
endstream
endobj
