BT /F1 10 Tf 54 365 Td (- Your Parish Hall with your real location.) Tj ET
BT /F1 10 Tf 54 344 Td (If registration is not open yet, remove the --registration-open line.) Tj ET
BT /F1 10 Tf 54 323 Td (To confirm the session exists, open pgAdmin and look in the program_sessions) Tj ET
BT /F1 10 Tf 54 309 Td (  table.) Tj ET
