BT /F1 10 Tf 54 258 Td (If everything is already installed and you just need to start working, run:) Tj ET
BT /F3 9 Tf 54 237 Td (./scripts/dev.sh) Tj ET
BT /F1 10 Tf 54 209 Td (Then open:) Tj ET
BT /F3 9 Tf 54 188 Td (http://localhost:3000) Tj ET
BT /F1 10 Tf 54 160 Td (If your helper set up system services instead, they may give you a different) Tj ET
BT /F1 10 Tf 54 146 Td (  startup command.) Tj ET
BT /F2 13 Tf 54 120 Td (Domain Name Setup) Tj ET
BT /F1 10 Tf 54 95 Td (Use this section if the chapter wants the site to open at a real web address, such) Tj ET
BT /F1 10 Tf 54 81 Td (  as example.org, instead of only an IP address.) Tj ET
BT /F1 10 Tf 54 60 Td (You will need:) Tj ET
endstream
