stream
BT /F2 13 Tf 54 733 Td (Common Problems) Tj ET
BT /F1 10 Tf 54 708 Td (Problem: permission denied) Tj ET
BT /F1 10 Tf 54 687 Td (Try:) Tj ET
BT /F3 9 Tf 54 666 Td (chmod +x scripts/*.sh) Tj ET
BT /F1 10 Tf 54 638 Td (Then run the command again.) Tj ET
BT /F1 10 Tf 54 617 Td (Problem: database does not exist or connection refused) Tj ET
BT /F1 10 Tf 54 596 Td (The database is not running or .env points to the wrong place. Send the error to) Tj ET
